<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Reduce downtimes" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Reduce downtimes</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Increase the service life of your equipment and reduce unplanned downtimes. Identify and eliminate weak points in your electrical energy supply to protect your valuable assets.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve efficiency" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve efficiency</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Save time and costs by identifying supply quality problems early. Comprehensive recording of network parameters allows you to be proactive and improve your operational efficiency and resource allocation.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Stay compliant" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Stay compliant</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Secure your investment with standard-compliant measurement procedures like IEC 61000-4-30 Class A Ed.3. Expect manufacturer-independent comparable measured values and interoperability with standard interfaces and protocols.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5ZpdAjYlvRgCpo1wZESBAa' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5ZpdAjYlvRgCpo1wZESBAa'><is-land on:visib