itle" aria-describedby="G_Data%20acquisition%20and%20reporting-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Data%20acquisition%20and%20reporting-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Data acquisition and reporting</h3><div id="G_Data%20acquisition%20and%20reporting-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Acquire, visualize, analyze and transmit alternating current characteristics: current, voltage, frequency and harmonics. Generate flexible analyses and reports, including EN 50160, for insights into your power system performance.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication controls" id="G_Communication%20controls-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20controls-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20controls-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20controls-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication controls</h3><div id="G_Communication%20controls-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Connect via 2x Ethernet (IEC61850, DNPP 3i, Modbus TCP) and Modbus RTU master. Secure communication with role-based access control, password protection and firmware signatures for operational integrity and data protection.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981